    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なにやってんだ、バカ野郎！
落ち着け!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The hell you think you're doin', coconut head?! Chill out!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>落ち着けるか！
何度呼びかけても
城内から反応がないんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How do you expect me to remain calm?! No matter how many times I call out, there's no response...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すでにゼロムは城内に入りこんで
パライバ様を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The xerom have most likely already entered the castle and killed her majesty...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>気持ちはわかるけど
お前とお前のソーマは
最後の希望なんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know how hard it must be, but you AND your Soma are the world's last hope!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>63024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……すまん、&lt;Shing&gt;……
自分でも、とめられないのだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Apologies, Shing... but I cannot control myself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>64312</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バカルセドニーッ！
ひとりでどうする気だよ!?
くそッ、オレも壁をよじ登って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You idiot! What do you think you're gonna do on your own?! Dammit, guess we gotta jump the wall...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>65276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だめだよ！　&lt;Shing&gt;こそ
ひとりでどうする気？
一旦戻って、みんなに相談しよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't! You said it yourself, you can't do it alone. Let's just go back and tell everyone what happened.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>65900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くっ…………わかったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tch... alright.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>69204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くぅ〜〜ん……
きゅぅ〜ん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hrm... *blush*</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>69496</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだかすっごく
悲しそうな声だ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>69760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>悲しそうな声……
