    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今の皇帝陛下が誰か……
もちろん知ってるわよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You do know who the current empress is, correct?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>統一帝国マクス第二代至上皇帝
パライバ陛下！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The second supreme ruler of the unified empire, Her Majesty Empress Paraiba!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>先代統一皇帝ジルコニア陛下の
姪御様で、まだお若くて
とても美しいお方なのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She was the niece of the previous Emperor Zirconia. She's still young, but very beautiful.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大変！　パライバ様が暴漢に
襲われたんですって!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How dreadful! Some thug tried to assassinate the Empress!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>パライバ様のお命を狙うなんて
許せないわっ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Targeting Empress Paraiba's life is unforgivable!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>パライバ様のお命を狙ったのは
許婚のカルセドニー様なんですって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I heard the one who was after her was her fiance, Chalcedony!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お似合いのおふたりだと
思っていたのにガッカリだわ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I thought they were the dream couple, so I don't know how to take this news...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……権力が人のスピリアを
惑わすのかしらねぇ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder if people in power just have malicious Spiria...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よかったぁ♪　やっぱり
パライバ様もカルセドニー様も
ステキな方だったのね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Phew! Thank goodness Lady Paraiba and Chalcedony were both good people after all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミーハーと呼ばれようが
私は、おふたりのために
頑張っちゃうわよ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know it's total poser behavior, but I'll do my best for the both of them! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これがマクス帝国城！
ひとつとなった世界の象徴じゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The is the Max Castle! A symbol of our unified world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>眺めているだけで
誇らしい気分になるのぅ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just looking at it fills me with pride.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バレイア教会の粛清なぞ
どうでもいい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who cares about the purge of the Velleian Church?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あのクリードとかいう奴こそ
人類の敵じゃろ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That Creed whippersnapper's an enemy to all mankind, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええぃ、帝国と軍は
もっとしっかりせんかいっ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The church and army better whips their acts together!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うおぉぉ〜〜〜血が騒ぐっ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oooh, now I'm all fired up!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わしも、化物どもと戦うぞぃ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll fight off them monsters, too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>12</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
