    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>帝国城の警備は
結晶騎士に任せられているのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Us Crystal Knights provide the castle's security.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>13</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ソーマを装備した我ら結晶騎士は
軍の兵士の数倍の力を
持っているのだから当然だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We;re the best choice for the job, as our Soma make us several times more powerful than a military soldier.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>13</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カルセドニーがパライバ様を
暗殺しようとしただと!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You say Chalcedony tried to assassinate Her Majesty?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>13</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バカな！　ありえんッ!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Foolish! There's no way!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>13</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>全ては軍の教会に対する陰謀だッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's all just some conspiracy the military cooked up to slander the church!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>13</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>再び帝国城の警備に
つける日が来るとは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I never thought there'd come a day where I was assigned to castle security again...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>13</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ソーマはなくなってしまったが
全力を尽くして守ってみせるぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I may not have my Soma anymore, but I'll still do everything in my power to protect everyone!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>13</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
