    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>夢を喰う魔物現る！　……か</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dream-eating monsters have appeared?! I wonder...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>14</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人間の醜い争いに怒った
ねむり姫様の崇りかもねぇ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Perhaps this is a blessing in disguise from Sleeping Beauty who's grown tired of our meaningless conflicts?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>14</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
