      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>より大きな外敵が現れると
ひとつにまとまる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When an even larger threat emerges, we can all unite as one.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>14</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ずいぶん勝手な習性だけど
これも人間の強さのひとつ
なんだよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though a very selfish habit, it is also one of humanity's greatest strengths.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>14</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレは格闘少女リン！
女だと思ってナメてると
ぶっとばすからな!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm the great brawler Rin! If you underestimate just 'cause I'm a girl, I'll knock your lights out!</EnglishText>
